WEBVTT

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:23.150
the wild and woolly west of old new towns sprang up overnight and as in most western towns

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:27.990
the biggest challenge of all was who's the fastest gun alive

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:31.240
You're not!

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:43.910
Looks like a tie!

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:48.380
Cash rewards attracted quick-triggered bounty hunters,

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:50.160
such as Quick-Draw McGraw,

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:52.520
the real fastest gun alive.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:54.520
Uh, uh, Mr. Quick-Draw?

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:55.320
Yup!

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:59.320
There's not much of a line, but it's the way I read it.

00:00:59.480 --> 00:00:59.820
Would you?

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:07.270
show us your famous quick draw quick draw yep there's nothing to it i just tossed this tin can

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:21.650
up in the air whip out the six gun and shucks i had the bullet in backwards side by side with

00:01:21.650 --> 00:01:28.140
quick draw mcgraw was his faithful friend and admirer baba louis hey then maybe we go back to

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:29.980
I'm hurting sheeps, don't you a thin s-

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:34.410
No, I don't think so, Quicksdraw.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:38.160
I'm gonna clean up this one-horse town.

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:40.850
Let me see here.

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:45.590
This is the easy one, Senior, Quicksdraw.

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:51.100
Fancy Foots Finnegan wanted for square dancing in a roundhouse.

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:54.600
Hold on, Bubba Louie.

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:56.450
We hit the jackpot.

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.240
$5,000 reward.

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:06.030
for the capture of the well-known pole cap, Grumbleweed.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:08.930
P.S. We give green stamps.

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:11.580
Are you loco?

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:13.960
Senor Grumbles will kill you to pieces.

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:18.300
Then I'll throw the pieces to the coyotes, tenderfoot.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:20.620
Whom's a tenderfoot?

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.520
You are.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:26.580
Oh, ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:28.760
What do you say, quick straw?

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:29.980
I said...

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:33.280
Oh, ouch, ow, ow, oh, gosh, ow, ow, ow!

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:39.780
Hey, we done robin'!

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:42.330
Ain't that against the law?

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:46.850
Any objections, horseface?

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.260
Kept thinkin' on offhand.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:54.350
Well, while you're thinkin', I dare you to over this line.

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:55.040
Okay.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:57.150
Now, step over this one.

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:57.890
Okay.

00:02:58.700 --> 00:02:59.220
This one.

00:02:59.440 --> 00:02:59.800
Okay.

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:02.440
Uh-oh!

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:07.140
Ta-ta!

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:08.100
Tenderfoot!

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:13.330
Quick straw!

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.080
Don't you think we better give up the whole thing?

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:17.620
Nope!

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:21.140
I'm still gonna clean up this one-horse town!

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:23.530
Leave us fix it!

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:26.370
A western delinquent!

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:29.980
Gonna surprise senor grum-

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:34.360
Yep, this Morocco grumbles to sleep.

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:38.170
Oh, whoa, I see.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:57.900
Couldn't Queegs draw?

00:03:58.580 --> 00:03:59.460
How do I know?

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:01.010
I just got here.

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:12.180
Oh, he'd sound asleep.

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:13.820
Now's my chance.

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:17.410
I'm going to pin him to that tree

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:20.590
with my William Tell do-it-yourself kit.

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:22.820
We the bars and arrows?

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:23.800
Yep.

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:27.620
Here, Baba Louie, put this apple on his noggin.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:29.270
It's okay.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:30.220
Yup.

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:32.060
I'm a terrible shot.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:36.420
If I aim at the apple, I'm bound to hit old Grombo-Weed.

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:38.380
Swing strong!

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:42.690
It's old Horseface again.

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:45.870
There goes Grimble's weed.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:47.820
All right, ho.

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:56.530
Will it work, please draw?

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:59.570
How can I miss with four guns?

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:01.580
It ain't easy, amigo.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:03.340
Take cover, Bubbly.

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:05.890
Here comes old Grumblesweed.

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:12.580
Oh, the hard-slide-quip-graw-type booby-trap up ahead.

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:20.300
Ready? Aim!

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:33.040
I have had enough of your treacherous...

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:33.720
Tricks!

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:38.320
You and me are going to have a showdown at sundown.

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:40.740
And don't you forget it.

00:05:41.350 --> 00:05:44.990
We'll take 10 steps, turn, and fire!

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.940
I seen him do this in a western movie once.

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:51.460
The hero always wins.

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.030
Ready?

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:54.290
One!

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:55.450
Dude!

00:05:56.070 --> 00:05:56.470
Three.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:58.030
Yeah.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:12.530
Six, seven, eight, nine, ten, we're givin' you one more chance, Scrumbly.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:15.130
Now play it fair and square.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:19.080
Okay, let me do the countin' this time.

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:22.050
I've seen that same movie.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:23.360
Ready?

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:28.960
One, two, four, six, eight, ten.

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:41.800
Admit one thing, Quigstraw is a man of his word.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:45.480
Meet Quigstraw McGraw, the fastest brood!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:50.840
I said I was gonna clean up this one-horse town,

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.260
and I'm a-gonna!
